# Contact + access-request delivery.
#
# A submission goes to every channel configured here and succeeds if any one of
# them accepts it. With none of them set, submissions are only written to the
# server log — fine locally, not fine in production.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# Email delivery (Resend). The API key and a sender on a domain you have
# verified with Resend are both required for email to be attempted at all.
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL="Neurasense <noreply@neurasense.io>"

# Where enquiries land. Defaults to hello@neurasense.io, the address published
# in the website privacy notice.
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=hello@neurasense.io

# Slack / Teams incoming webhook. Optional, and independent of the above.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
